DESCRIPTION:Chris Ford\, known for his sharp wit and infectious charm\, bri
 ngs his show to the stage with humour and honesty. Blending stories of grow
 ing up as a strict Jehovah’s Witness with life as an A&E nurse\, he explo
 res identity\, belief and resilience. Through sharp storytelling and self-d
 eprecating humour\, he reflects on teenage years shaped by faith\, shame an
 d desire in a world where questioning was forbidden. From queer awakenings 
 to the absurdities of NHS life\, this is raw\, heartfelt\, laugh-out-loud c
 omedy with a story that deserves to be heard.\nMore info: https://comedyatl
 as.app/comedy-atlas/event/jehovah-s-witness-for-the-prosecution-work-in-pro
 gress/
